		(descr "Samtec TSW-102-16-G-D-RA exact 2x2 2.54 mm right-angle THT male header. Drawing-derived double-row body is 5.08 x 6.10 mm; lead style -16 gives C=8.13 mm mating length, E=5.08 mm board-tail length, and D=1.52 mm right-angle offset. Pads follow Samtec odd/even-by-column numbering: 1/2 left column, 3/4 right column. The in-plane mating envelope is modeled to the C dimension; first-article mated-transform and engagement verification remains mandatory.")
